"type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Promises", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Future tense (with <span class=\"italic\">will</span>) to make promises.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can start the sentence with \u201cI promise I'll \u2026 \u201d or \u201cI promise to \u2026 \u201d. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You can respond to promises with an expression like:  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span  class=\"italic\">Great, thank you!<br> Alright.<br> OK. <br>That's fine.<br> Sure, that works.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I will help you with your math homework tomorrow.<br><span class=\"strong\">Helen</span>:  Great, thank you!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I promise I'll take the courses this summer. <br><span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>:  Alright.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "co-op program ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "A program of study combined with work experiences. Co-op is short for co-operative.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I'm in the co-op program in the Business department.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about programs of study.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "accounting ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "professional activity of keeping financial records ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm enrolled in an accounting course next term.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "human resources ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "department of a company responsible for hiring employees, also called HR ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have an HR course starting next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "math", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short form of mathematics, the study of the calculation of numbers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Math is important for accounting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "registrar", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the person or office responsible for enrolling students in an educational institution ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  You have to apply to the Registrar for special permission.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "obligatory ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes something you have to do ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Those courses are obligatory for your degree. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to enroll", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to sign up; to be registered to take a course", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I enrolled in three courses this term.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "course ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a series of lessons about a certain topic ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I enrolled in four courses next term.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le10ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a list of 6 hypothetical situations on separate pieces of paper. Use the Present tense, like <span class=\"italic\">I take a co-op program</span> or <span class=\"italic\">I study accounting</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask a partner to write another 6 situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Combine the papers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take one paper. Complete a sentence using the situation on the paper. Use the <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIf ... + I will ...\u201d</span> structure, like <span class=\"italic\">If I take a co-op program, I will work in a large company</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain why.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner takes a paper and completes a sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Continue taking turns.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write 6 situations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice making hypothetical statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss why.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le10ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hello. I'm working as an intern at a software company right now.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: Oh yes, that's the co-op program in the business department."}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "8000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes. I would like to continue working there. If I stay at the company, I'll gain a lot of valuable experience in my field.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: OK.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I enrolled in one math, two accounting and one HR course starting next week. I won't be able to work at MechaTech if I start the courses."}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "26000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: Those courses are obligatory for your degree. Maybe you could study part-time.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Do you mean take fewer courses?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>:  Yes. You have to apply to the Registrar for special permission. If you take two courses now, you will take other courses during the summer."}, {"image": "engenn5le10ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "43000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Great!  I promise I'll take the courses this summer. Thank you!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Registrar</span>: Alright, here's the application form."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about subjects to study.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can talk about hypothetical actions and events in the future. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can make and respond to promises.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When do you make promises? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What promises do you make?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "